[ti:“Roach Sirens”]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Hip-Hop & Rap]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Kisi ki nafrat, kisi ka gussa
[00:11.67]Kisi ki maut, kisi ka kissa
[00:15.33]Har shakhs tha khada pal do pal yahan
[00:19.00]Thama sa ruka sa.. ab so gaya kyun?
[00:22.67]Pent khulwaye, khatna dhekhe
[00:26.34]Fir bhage ye jaan ko leke
[00:30.00]Inki lelo ek pal main jaan
[00:33.67]Fafed do is tarah ki tauba kare subah shaam
[00:37.34]They ran like roaches when the sirens came
[00:41.00]But they left behind blood and a mother's name
[00:44.67]You want heaven? I'll show you hell's gate
[00:48.34]One call — I'll make your whole crew late
[00:52.00]Tarbiyat? Taaleem? Nah that's a lie
[00:55.67]Kaun tha inka chhupa aaleem? Tell me why
[00:59.34]You teach a kid to kill before he learns to read?
[01:03.01]That's not a religion — that's a devil's seed
[01:06.67]Who raised you? Who trained you?
[01:10.34]Who's the hidden master behind the pain?
[01:14.01]You take a life — you take the chain
[01:17.67]Now every shadow whispers your name..
[01:21.34]22 April.. Pahalgam.. we remember
[01:25.01]This is not a drill — this is not a test
[01:28.67]You took their breath — now we take the rest
[01:32.34]I don't need a fatwa — I don't need a crown
[01:36.01]One step wrong — I'll tear your whole doctrine down
[01:39.68]Jalwa dikhaun, aag barsaun
[01:43.34]Har ek bhaage, raah na paaye
[01:47.01]Tauba karega har subah shaam
[01:50.68]Jab tera apna khoon chillayega — "Ya Allah, kyun?
[01:54.34]You asked for tarbiyat? You asked for taaleem?
[01:58.01]Here's your lesson — no mercy, no esteem
[02:01.68]The world watched Pahalgam bleed on a screen
[02:05.34]Now the world watches you.. deleted.. unseen
[02:09.01]Thama sa ruka sa.. ab jaag kyun gaya
[02:12.68]Har aansu, har laash, ek sawaal hai
[02:16.35]CHUPA AALIM — COME OUT AND FACE ME
[02:20.01]YOUR NAME ON THE WALL — YOUR THRONE — ERASE IT
[02:23.68]EVERY TOWN, EVERY TEMPLE, EVERY STREET, EVERY MOSQUE
[02:27.35]WE DON'T FORGET — WE DON'T STOP — WE DON'T DROP THIS
[02:31.01]Main darta hoon.. par main bhagogi nahi..
